## Task
Create local embeddings service using HuggingFace transformers.js.

## Context
Replaces OpenAI embeddings API with local model (all-MiniLM-L6-v2).
Generates 384-dimensional vectors locally, no API costs.

## Key Files
- api/src/services/local-embeddings.ts (CREATE)
- api/package.json (add dependency)

## Implementation

### Step 1: Install dependency
```bash
cd api && npm install @xenova/transformers
```

### Step 2: Create service
```typescript
// api/src/services/local-embeddings.ts
import { pipeline } from '@xenova/transformers';

// Lazy-load the model (downloads on first use, ~90MB)
let embedder: any = null;

async function getEmbedder() {
  if (!embedder) {
    embedder = await pipeline('feature-extraction', 'Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2');
  }
  return embedder;
}

export async function generateLocalEmbedding(text: string): Promise<number[]> {
  const embed = await getEmbedder();
  const output = await embed(text, { pooling: 'mean', normalize: true });
  return Array.from(output.data);
}

export const LOCAL_EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS = 384;
```

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] @xenova/transformers added to api/package.json
- [ ] File api/src/services/local-embeddings.ts exists
- [ ] Exports generateLocalEmbedding(text) function
- [ ] Exports LOCAL_EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS = 384 constant
- [ ] Uses lazy initialization (model loaded on first call)
- [ ] Build passes: `cd api && npm run build`

## Verification Test
```bash
cd api && npx tsx -e "
import { generateLocalEmbedding, LOCAL_EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS } from './src/services/local-embeddings.js';
const vec = await generateLocalEmbedding('test');
console.log('Dimensions:', vec.length, '(expected', LOCAL_EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS, ')');
console.assert(vec.length === 384, 'Wrong dimensions');
"
```

## Notes
- First run downloads ~90MB model (cached after)
- Model: Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
- 384 dims vs OpenAI's 1536 - smaller but good quality

## Task
Replace OpenAI embeddings API with local HuggingFace model.

## Context
embeddings.ts currently uses OpenAI text-embedding-3-small (1536 dims).
After this change, it uses local all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (384 dims).

## Key Files
- api/src/services/embeddings.ts (MODIFY)
- api/src/services/local-embeddings.ts (REFERENCE)

## Current State (lines 1-45)
```typescript
import OpenAI from 'openai';

let openai: OpenAI | null = null;
function getOpenAIClient(): OpenAI {...}

const EMBEDDING_MODEL = 'text-embedding-3-small';
const EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS = 1536;
const MAX_CHUNK_CHARS = 30000;

export async function generateEmbedding(text: string): Promise<number[]> {
  const client = getOpenAIClient();
  const truncatedText = text.length > MAX_CHUNK_CHARS ? text.slice(0, MAX_CHUNK_CHARS) : text;
  const response = await client.embeddings.create({
    model: EMBEDDING_MODEL,
    input: truncatedText,
  });
  return response.data[0].embedding;
}
```

